    "The cut renders in the cloud at full quality, then lands in your photo library. It keeps going if you leave this screen." : {
      "comment" : "Here the camera roll and photo library are the iPhone's Photos library; use Apple's own word for it in this language.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Schnitt rendert in voller Qualität in der Cloud und landet dann in deiner Fotomediathek. Der Vorgang läuft weiter, wenn du diesen Bildschirm verlässt."
